  unitName: Dark Idol
  unitId: 60122
  unitNumber: 188
  description: Worshipers of the dark gave this miraculous stone idol life through
    prayer. Known as the devil idol, it is said to be cursed, and anyone who sees
    it as well as those around them will face misfortune. The statue's power of prayer
    turns into a powerful curse with time, but after overcoming that it's said that
    it can awaken a great power hidden from within others.
  summonDesc: I am a Dark Idol.<br>You seem to know my purpose.<br>I will go with
    you.
